Modified for Greenroom: original renderer web transport, member-private project/media
storage, managed model access, persistent background jobs and DSH MCP integration.
The running UI offers the complete corresponding modified source for download.

Build the already-adapted source archive with Node.js 24:
  npm ci --ignore-scripts --no-audit --no-fund
  npx vite build --config vite.greenroom.config.ts
  npx esbuild src/greenroom-worker.ts --bundle --platform=node --format=esm --target=node24 --packages=external --alias:@=./src --alias:@opencut/ai-core=./src/packages/ai-core --define:import.meta.env.BASE_URL='"/plugins/moyin/"' --outfile=greenroom-worker.mjs
Run node greenroom-server.mjs with GREENROOM_PLUGIN_ROOT set to a writable member
private directory, GREENROOM_MANAGED_URL to the authenticated member bridge,
GREENROOM_BROKER_URL to its OpenAI-compatible broker, and GREENROOM_BASE_PATH to
/plugins/moyin/. The source archive includes greenroom-integration/ with the
upstream preparation recipe, Dockerfile, manifest and static MCP declarations.
